meta {
  name: Fail Callback
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/payment/fail
  body: form
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
}

body:form {
  value_a: {{orderId}}
}

docs {
  ## Payment Fail Callback

  SSLCommerz failure callback. Called when the payment fails.
  The order and escrow remain in PENDING/UNPAID state.

  ### Form Data
  | Parameter | Type   | Description |
  |-----------|--------|-------------|
  | value_a   | string | Order ID    |

  ### Result (303 Redirect)
  Redirects to `/profile/orders/{{orderId}}?payment=failed`
}
